# Addon module map

## Non-negotiables

- Prefer extending planned modules over new top-level files
- Expand TOC only when the file exists
- UI→Core→Data / Net→Core→Data; never Core→UI
- Lifecycle detail: `toc-lifecycle.mdc`. Style: `lua-cob-modules.mdc`

## Put code here

| `COB` key | File | Owns |
|-----------|------|------|
| `Ranks` | `Data/Ranks.lua` | ids, titles, thresholds, seats, officer index max |
| `DB` | `Core/DB.lua` | `ChurchOfBeefDB` shape, defaults, migrate |
| `Officer` | `Core/Officer.lua` | roster rank-index gate (Officer+ check) |
| `Roster` | `Core/Roster.lua` | live guild snapshot → Church ladder view |
| `Scoring` | `Core/Scoring.lua` | grants, caps, anti-AFK buckets |
| `Ladder` | `Core/Ladder.lua` | standing + promote suggestions |
| `Gora` / `Ceremony` / `Instance` | matching `Core/*.lua` | thin domain → Scoring |
| `Net` | `Net/BeefNet.lua` | send/recv, validate, dispatch into Core |
| `Sync` | `Net/Sync.lua` | `SYNC_REQUEST` / `SYNC_STATE` |
| `UI` | `UI/MainFrame.lua` (+ tabs) | frames; tabs are views over Core |

## Coupling

```
✅ Roster update: GUILD_ROSTER_UPDATE → Roster:Refresh → UI refresh
✅ Promote prompt: Scoring → Ladder:MaybeSuggest → Officer tab Dismiss
✅ Standing correction: UI → Ladder:CorrectStanding (points only)

❌ Core → UI / CreateFrame / SendAddonMessage / slash
❌ Points granted in Toasts, Announce, or tab files
❌ Net inventing ranks; RANK_COMMIT must not apply under roster-backed model
❌ Second officer-gate outside Core/Officer.lua
❌ Guild promote/demote API calls from the addon
```
